#. module: om_whatsapp_sale
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_whatsapp_sale
msgid ""
"Bridge between Sales and the WhatsApp connector of Odoo Mates: ready "
"WhatsApp templates and a Send by WhatsApp button on quotations and sales "
"orders, with the PDF and the link to view, sign and pay online; the "
"quotation is marked as sent, and the order confirmation can go "
"automatically, once, when the order is confirmed (online orders included)."
msgstr ""

